### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### API root
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### Run synthetic multi-hop trace (recommended first)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/traces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "bc1qaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "chain": "bitcoin",
  "max_hops": 4,
  "limit": 30,
  "use_sample": true
}

### Replace the sample subject with a real Bitcoin address and set use_sample=false
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/traces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "REPLACE_WITH_REAL_BTC_ADDRESS",
  "chain": "bitcoin",
  "max_hops": 3,
  "limit": 20,
  "use_sample": false
}

### Audit verification
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/security/audit/verify

### Security capabilities
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/security/capabilities

### After creating a trace, replace TRACE_ID below
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/reports/TRACE_ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/graphs/TRACE_ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/risk/TRACE_ID/receivers
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/graphs/TRACE_ID/visualize
